WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:18.247
Theo: Watch out! The curtain is blowing away.

2
00:00:18.248 --> 00:00:22.398
Riley: Snooks is hiding under the porch.

3
00:00:22.399 --> 00:00:27.616
Sarah: Oh no. Mittens doesn't like to get wet!

4
00:00:27.617 --> 00:00:30.393
Skyler: Neither does Chatter.

5
00:00:30.394 --> 00:00:34.526
Ben: Catch the curtain before it blows away!

6
00:00:34.527 --> 00:00:41.129
Theo: I've got it.

7
00:00:41.130 --> 00:00:43.762
Riley: There's more thunder.

8
00:00:43.763 --> 00:00:52.146
Skyler: Everyone, get inside. Quick!

9
00:00:52.147 --> 00:00:56.878
Riley: Look, the sun is coming out already!

10
00:00:56.879 --> 00:00:59.589
Theo: But it's still raining.

11
00:00:59.590 --> 00:01:04.061
Skyler: I see a rainbow!

12
00:01:04.062 --> 00:01:07.974
Chatter: Pretty rainbow!

13
00:01:07.975 --> 00:01:10.521
Sarah: A rainbow!

14
00:01:10.522 --> 00:01:13.966
Riley: Let's all make a wish.

15
00:01:13.967 --> 00:01:15.991
Skyler: Close your eyes!

16
00:01:15.992 --> 00:01:24.807
Ben: And don't tell anyone your wish.

17
00:01:24.808 --> 00:01:26.477
Here I come, Speedy.

18
00:01:26.478 --> 00:01:29.319
Ben: The storm is over.

19
00:01:29.320 --> 00:01:34.273
Skyler: And so is our pet show.

20
00:01:34.274 --> 00:01:38.732
Boy: That was a great show!

21
00:01:38.733 --> 00:01:42.501
Girl: Look, your turtle is hiding.

22
00:01:42.502 --> 00:01:46.296
Ben: Yep. Speedy always hides inside his shell.

23
00:01:46.297 --> 00:01:49.179
Skyler: He's very good at hiding.

24
00:01:49.180 --> 00:01:52.911
Girl: I wish I could hide like that.

25
00:01:52.912 --> 00:01:57.805
Theo: Yeah, when it's time for a test at school!

26
00:01:57.806 --> 00:02:01.964
Riley: Or when we're having peas for dinner!

27
00:02:01.965 --> 00:02:08.323
Kelli: Or when my mom says, "Clean up your room."

28
00:02:08.324 --> 00:02:10.693
Ben: Speedy's shell protects him.

29
00:02:10.694 --> 00:02:13.618
Today it protected him from the storm.

30
00:02:13.619 --> 00:02:17.517
Boy: That's an amazing trick.

31
00:02:17.518 --> 00:02:20.831
Theo: It sure is.

32
00:02:20.832 --> 00:02:23.743
Ben: I wished that Speedy could do a great trick.

33
00:02:23.744 --> 00:02:28.758
But he already knew one!
